  "stem": "The graph of a linear function in the \\(xy\\)-plane passes through the points \\((-1, 3)\\) and \\((3, 15)\\). What is the slope of the graph?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Slope \\(= \\frac{15 - 3}{3 - (-1)}\\).",
    "\\(= \\frac{12}{4} = 3\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "m = Rational(15 - 3, 3 - (-1))\nassert m == 3\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [m]",
